     "value": "Detected in lung vascular smooth muscle (at protein level) (PubMed:27144530). Detected in thyroid and extraocular smooth muscle, but not skeletal muscle (PubMed:2026759). Detected in heart, aorta, skeletal muscle, colon, urinary bladder, uterus, stomach, and small intestine (PubMed:11318603)"
    }
   ],
